<title>THAILAND: Securities One says to sell First Asia to Amsteel.</title>
<headline>Securities One says to sell First Asia to Amsteel.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Securities One Plc said on Tuesday it has signed an agreement to sell First Asia Securities Ltd to a group led by Malaysia's Amsteel Capital Holdings Bhd.</p>
<p>&quot;On Friday a group led by Amsteel Capital Holdings Bhd signed a memorandum of understanding to buy FAS from Securities One. Negotiations are on-going and pricing is dependent on due diligence but we are expecting final agreement by the end of June,&quot; a spokeswoman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Amsteel is a unit of Amsteel Corp Bhd.</p>
</text>
